       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TACCTPST.
      *================================================================*
      * UNIT TESTS FOR ACCTPOST - THE SINGLE POSTING PATH: STATUS      *
      * RULES, MINIMUM BALANCE, OVERDRAFT, BANK CHARGES, BAD REQUESTS, *
      * TRANSACTION LOG AND THE GL DOUBLE ENTRY BEHIND EVERY POSTING   *
      *================================================================*
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT ACCT-FILE ASSIGN TO 'data/ACCTMAST.DAT'
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
               RECORD KEY IS ACCT-NO FILE STATUS IS UT-ACCT-FS.
           SELECT TRAN-FILE ASSIGN TO 'data/TRANLOG.DAT'
               ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS WS-TRAN-FS.
           SELECT GL-FILE ASSIGN TO 'data/GLMAST.DAT'
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
               RECORD KEY IS GL-CODE FILE STATUS IS WS-GL-FS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  ACCT-FILE.
           COPY ACCTREC.
       FD  TRAN-FILE.
           COPY TRANREC.
       FD  GL-FILE.
           COPY GLREC.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
           COPY POSTPARM.
           COPY UTWS.
           COPY UTSEEDW.
       01  WS-TRAN-FS                  PIC X(02).
       01  WS-GL-FS                    PIC X(02).
       01  WS-LINES                    PIC 9(05).
       01  WS-EOF                      PIC X(01).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN.
           MOVE 'ACCTPOST' TO UT-SUITE
      *    SAVINGS 10,000 (MIN 1,000), CURRENT 5,000 (OD 20,000),
      *    FROZEN, DORMANT
           MOVE 1000000001 TO UT-SEED-NO
           MOVE 'S' TO UT-SEED-TYPE
           MOVE 'A' TO UT-SEED-STATUS
           MOVE 10000 TO UT-SEED-BALANCE
           MOVE 1000 TO UT-SEED-MIN
           MOVE ZERO TO UT-SEED-OD
           MOVE 'DEL001' TO UT-SEED-BRANCH
           PERFORM UT-SEED-ACCOUNT
           MOVE 1000000002 TO UT-SEED-NO
           MOVE 'C' TO UT-SEED-TYPE
           MOVE 5000 TO UT-SEED-BALANCE
           MOVE ZERO TO UT-SEED-MIN
           MOVE 20000 TO UT-SEED-OD
           PERFORM UT-SEED-ACCOUNT
           MOVE 1000000003 TO UT-SEED-NO
           MOVE 'S' TO UT-SEED-TYPE
           MOVE 'F' TO UT-SEED-STATUS
           MOVE 1000 TO UT-SEED-MIN
           MOVE ZERO TO UT-SEED-OD
           PERFORM UT-SEED-ACCOUNT
           MOVE 1000000004 TO UT-SEED-NO
           MOVE 'D' TO UT-SEED-STATUS
           PERFORM UT-SEED-ACCOUNT

           MOVE 'INQUIRY: AVAILABLE = BALANCE - MINIMUM' TO UT-NAME
           PERFORM 8000-RESET
           SET PP-INQUIRE TO TRUE
           MOVE 1000000001 TO PP-ACCT-NO
           CALL 'ACCTPOST' USING POST-PARMS
           MOVE 9000 TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE PP-AVAILABLE TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM

           MOVE 'INQUIRY: CURRENT AVAILABLE INCLUDES OD' TO UT-NAME
           MOVE 1000000002 TO PP-ACCT-NO
           CALL 'ACCTPOST' USING POST-PARMS
           MOVE 25000 TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE PP-AVAILABLE TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM

           MOVE 'CREDIT 2,500 -> BALANCE 12,500' TO UT-NAME
           PERFORM 8000-RESET
           SET PP-CREDIT TO TRUE
           MOVE 1000000001 TO PP-ACCT-NO
           MOVE 2500 TO PP-AMOUNT
           MOVE 'DP' TO PP-TRAN-TYPE
           CALL 'ACCTPOST' USING POST-PARMS
           MOVE 12500 TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE PP-BALANCE TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM

           MOVE 'DEBIT BELOW MINIMUM BALANCE -> RC 30' TO UT-NAME
           PERFORM 8000-RESET
           SET PP-DEBIT TO TRUE
           MOVE 1000000001 TO PP-ACCT-NO
           MOVE 12000 TO PP-AMOUNT
           MOVE 'WD' TO PP-TRAN-TYPE
           CALL 'ACCTPOST' USING POST-PARMS
           MOVE 30 TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE PP-RETURN-CODE TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM

           MOVE 'REFUSED DEBIT LEAVES BALANCE ALONE' TO UT-NAME
           MOVE 1000000001 TO UT-SEED-NO
           PERFORM UT-READ-ACCOUNT
           MOVE 12500 TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE ACCT-BALANCE TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM

           MOVE 'CHARGE MAY DIP BELOW MINIMUM (NOT ZERO)' TO UT-NAME
           PERFORM 8000-RESET
           SET PP-DEBIT TO TRUE
           MOVE 1000000001 TO PP-ACCT-NO
           MOVE 12000 TO PP-AMOUNT
           MOVE 'CH' TO PP-TRAN-TYPE
           MOVE 'Y' TO PP-IGNORE-MIN-BAL
           CALL 'ACCTPOST' USING POST-PARMS
           MOVE 500 TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE PP-BALANCE TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM

           MOVE 'CHARGE NEVER TAKES BALANCE BELOW ZERO' TO UT-NAME
           MOVE 600 TO PP-AMOUNT
           CALL 'ACCTPOST' USING POST-PARMS
           MOVE 30 TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE PP-RETURN-CODE TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM

           MOVE 'OVERDRAFT: DEBIT UP TO BALANCE + LIMIT' TO UT-NAME
           PERFORM 8000-RESET
           SET PP-DEBIT TO TRUE
           MOVE 1000000002 TO PP-ACCT-NO
           MOVE 25000 TO PP-AMOUNT
           MOVE 'WD' TO PP-TRAN-TYPE
           CALL 'ACCTPOST' USING POST-PARMS
           MOVE -20000 TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE PP-BALANCE TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM

           MOVE 'OVERDRAFT: ONE RUPEE MORE -> RC 30' TO UT-NAME
           MOVE 1 TO PP-AMOUNT
           CALL 'ACCTPOST' USING POST-PARMS
           MOVE 30 TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE PP-RETURN-CODE TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM

           MOVE 'FROZEN ACCOUNT: CREDIT -> RC 20' TO UT-NAME
           PERFORM 8000-RESET
           SET PP-CREDIT TO TRUE
           MOVE 1000000003 TO PP-ACCT-NO
           MOVE 100 TO PP-AMOUNT
           MOVE 'DP' TO PP-TRAN-TYPE
           CALL 'ACCTPOST' USING POST-PARMS
           MOVE 20 TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE PP-RETURN-CODE TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM

           MOVE 'DORMANT ACCOUNT: CREDIT ALLOWED' TO UT-NAME
           MOVE 1000000004 TO PP-ACCT-NO
           CALL 'ACCTPOST' USING POST-PARMS
           MOVE ZERO TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE PP-RETURN-CODE TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM

           MOVE 'DORMANT ACCOUNT: CUSTOMER DEBIT -> RC 20' TO UT-NAME
           PERFORM 8000-RESET
           SET PP-DEBIT TO TRUE
           MOVE 1000000004 TO PP-ACCT-NO
           MOVE 100 TO PP-AMOUNT
           MOVE 'WD' TO PP-TRAN-TYPE
           CALL 'ACCTPOST' USING POST-PARMS
           MOVE 20 TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE PP-RETURN-CODE TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM

           MOVE 'DORMANT ACCOUNT: BANK DEBIT ALLOWED' TO UT-NAME
           MOVE 'CH' TO PP-TRAN-TYPE
           MOVE 'Y' TO PP-SYSTEM-TXN
           CALL 'ACCTPOST' USING POST-PARMS
           MOVE ZERO TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE PP-RETURN-CODE TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM

           MOVE 'BANK DEBIT DOES NOT WAKE A DORMANT ACCOUNT' TO UT-NAME
           MOVE 1000000004 TO UT-SEED-NO
           PERFORM UT-READ-ACCOUNT
           MOVE 'D' TO UT-EXPECTED-STR
           MOVE ACCT-STATUS TO UT-ACTUAL-STR
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-STR

           MOVE 'UNKNOWN ACCOUNT -> RC 10' TO UT-NAME
           PERFORM 8000-RESET
           SET PP-CREDIT TO TRUE
           MOVE 1999999999 TO PP-ACCT-NO
           MOVE 1 TO PP-AMOUNT
           CALL 'ACCTPOST' USING POST-PARMS
           MOVE 10 TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE PP-RETURN-CODE TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM

           MOVE 'ZERO AMOUNT -> RC 40' TO UT-NAME
           MOVE 1000000001 TO PP-ACCT-NO
           MOVE ZERO TO PP-AMOUNT
           CALL 'ACCTPOST' USING POST-PARMS
           MOVE 40 TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE PP-RETURN-CODE TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM

           MOVE 'BAD FUNCTION -> RC 40' TO UT-NAME
           MOVE 'Z' TO PP-FUNCTION
           MOVE 1 TO PP-AMOUNT
           CALL 'ACCTPOST' USING POST-PARMS
           MOVE 40 TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE PP-RETURN-CODE TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM

      *    5 SUCCESSFUL POSTINGS: DP, CH, WD (OD), DP (DORMANT), CH
           MOVE 'ONE TRANSACTION LOG LINE PER POSTING' TO UT-NAME
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-LINES
           OPEN INPUT TRAN-FILE
           MOVE 'N' TO WS-EOF
           PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = 'Y'
               READ TRAN-FILE
                   AT END MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF
                   NOT AT END ADD 1 TO WS-LINES
               END-READ
           END-PERFORM
           CLOSE TRAN-FILE
           MOVE 5 TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE WS-LINES TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM

      *    SAVINGS GL MOVED BY +2,500 -12,000 +100 -100 = -9,500
      *    (CREDITS ARE NEGATIVE ON A LIABILITY GL)
           MOVE 'GL 2101 CARRIES THE SAVINGS MOVEMENTS' TO UT-NAME
           OPEN INPUT GL-FILE
           MOVE 2101 TO GL-CODE
           READ GL-FILE INVALID KEY MOVE ZERO TO GL-BALANCE END-READ
           MOVE 9500 TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE GL-BALANCE TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM
           MOVE 'GL 2102 CARRIES THE OVERDRAFT DEBIT' TO UT-NAME
           MOVE 2102 TO GL-CODE
           READ GL-FILE INVALID KEY MOVE ZERO TO GL-BALANCE END-READ
           MOVE 25000 TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE GL-BALANCE TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM
           MOVE 'FEE INCOME GL CREDITED WITH BOTH CHARGES' TO UT-NAME
           MOVE 4101 TO GL-CODE
           READ GL-FILE INVALID KEY MOVE ZERO TO GL-BALANCE END-READ
           MOVE -12100 TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE GL-BALANCE TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM
           CLOSE GL-FILE

           PERFORM UT-FINISH
           STOP RUN.

       8000-RESET.
           INITIALIZE POST-PARMS
           MOVE 'UNIT TEST' TO PP-NARRATION.

           COPY UTSEEDP.
           COPY UTPROC.
